  "description": "TUKDOU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C103 H145 Dy6 N14 O44 Zn2 1+,31(C1 H4 O1),N1 O3 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.744-5.027 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.79-171.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6Zn2(CO3)5(OH)(H2L)4(H3L)2(H4L)]NO3·32MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
